Server init.
>> a := Blob nyowani: 4.
a bytes: ( Rondedzero nyowani ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nyowani: 4.
b bytes: ( Rondedzero nyowani ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a nyowani.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Zvabuda nyora: ( a ^ c ), mutsara-mutsva. } bata: { :e Zvabuda nyora: e, mutsara-mutsva. }, tanga.
a sunungura.
b sunungura.
